      {
        "id": 115237,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-18T20:01:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Reach does not increase Origin, nor does it increase Radius.</p><p>For vertices you count hexes, then a vertex of that hex. &nbsp;It works like Omni-tron moving.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So Grenade Launcher with Artillery you would:</p><p>Count up to three hexes from Bunker, then pick your Vertex.</p><p>When you calculate range to the targets if your initial selected Hex was elevation 1, and a target on one of the other two Hexes was at elevation 4 they would count as being range 4-3=1.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you counted Vertices it would be impossible to calculate range to the targets, esp. if the elevations for each hex was different.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:21.700Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
