        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Would &quot;Reach&quot; theoretically extend the range of Melee/non-Origin powers to beyond 6 hexes? &nbsp;For example, +3 Reach allow for these powers to work up to a range of 9?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
