      {
        "id": 115241,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-19T02:15:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, a regular attack like Razor Ordinance can target anyone in LoS, if they are at 7+ range you just won't have dice make range. &nbsp;With Reach you can make range. &nbsp;I've used an Aimed Omni-cannon with Bunker's reach+3 to nail someone at range 9. &nbsp;They thought they were safe, puny mortal. &nbsp;Aim is awesome there because you need one 6 and every non-auto miss turns into a 6 and makes range.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:22.019Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11019,
        "topic_slug": "reach-and-origin-and-vertex-attacks",
        "display_username": "phantaskippy",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yes, a regular attack like Razor Ordinance can target anyone in LoS, if they are at 7+ range you just won&#39;t have dice make range. &nbsp;With Reach you can make range. &nbsp;I&#39;ve used an Aimed Omni-cannon with Bunker&#39;s reach+3 to nail someone at range 9. &nbsp;They thought they were safe, puny mortal. &nbsp;Aim is awesome there because you need one 6 and every non-auto miss turns into a 6 and makes range.</p>",
