      {
        "id": 115242,
        "name": "SeraAlexandria",
        "username": "SeraAlexandria",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-19T06:58:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"guybacca\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/977dab/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> guybacca:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Would \"Reach\" theoretically extend the range of <strong>Melee</strong>/non-Origin powers to beyond 6 hexes? &nbsp;For example, +3 Reach allow for these powers to work up to a range of 9?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Everything Phanta said was correct. I didn't see anything about melee though so I'm going to clear that up in case there's any confusion. You have to be Adjacent for a melee attack. Reach does affect them, because they still have to make range when it comes to elevation and stuff, but it doesn't change the fact that you have to be adjacent to the target to do the attack.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:22.089Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
