        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"guybacca\"]\n\nWould &quot;Reach&quot; theoretically extend the range of <strong>Melee</strong>/non-Origin powers to beyond 6 hexes? &nbsp;For example, +3 Reach allow for these powers to work up to a range of 9?\n\n[/quote]\n\nEverything Phanta said was correct. I didn&#39;t see anything about melee though so I&#39;m going to clear that up in case there&#39;s any confusion. You have to be Adjacent for a melee attack. Reach does affect them, because they still have to make range when it comes to elevation and stuff, but it doesn&#39;t change the fact that you have to be adjacent to the target to do the attack.\n",
