        "created_at": "2014-08-19T14:43:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Came here to ask this exact question. &nbsp;Glad I'm not the only one who had trouble with reach. &nbsp;One other question though. &nbsp;Do multiple instances of reach stack? &nbsp;If I remember correctly, Bunker has inate reach 3 and one of his power cards has reach 4. &nbsp;Does that mean he has reach 7 when using that attack?</p>",
